:Bootloader running in RAM -- exercise its own opcode set

# OP_SET_ADDR 0x20000000: point WPTR=RPTR at the base of RAM
>00 02 00 00 04 20 00 00 00
<90 00

# OP_READ 0x10: read 16 bytes from RPTR (contents unknown -> wildcards), then SW
>00 03 00 00 10
<XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX XX 90 00
